e camera gazes out upon a lush expanse of vibrant green grass, stretching as far as the eye can see. In the distance, a majestic range of crimson-hued rock formations rises majestically, their rugged facades adorned with swirling patterns of turquoise and gold.\n\nAs the eye wanders across the landscape, a lone figure can be seen standing in the foreground, diminutive in comparison to the towering cliffs. The sense of scale and perspective is masterfully conveyed, drawing the viewer's attention to the tiny, yet significant, presence of the character amidst the vast, natural beauty.\n\nThe sky above is a brilliant blue, punctuated by puffy white clouds that drift lazily across the horizon. The warm, golden light of the sun casts a sense of tranquility over the scene, imbuing the image with a deep sense of serenity and peace.\n\nIn the foreground, a stylized logo of the 'Genshin Impact' franchise can be seen, a testament to the game's influence on this captivating image. The overall effect is one of breathtaking wonder, inviting the viewer to step into the world of 'Genshin Impact' and experience the magic for themselves.\""], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 411, "label": "text", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {}, "id": 221, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 16}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 3, "name": "STRING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [428], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING"}], "size": [210, 89.99999809265137], "pos": [-183, 108], "widgets_values": ["", "", ","], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text1"}, "name": "text1", "link": 427, "slot_index": 0, "type": "STRING"}, {"widget": {"name": "text2"}, "name": "text2", "link": 421, "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 274, "type": "Concat Text _O", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "Concat Text _O"}, "order": 18}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 3, "name": "STRING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [427], "l